\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Bottleneck shift across eight peer cadences (40-seed sweep). Top: $P(M^\star |R^\star )$ falls and $P(C^\star |M^\star )$ rises in $K$ (moderate, cluster-robust Spearman effect sizes $-0.53$ and $+0.43$; CIs in Appendix~\ref {app:effect-sizes}). Bottom: mean time-to-success has an interior minimum at $K=8$ ($7.47$ ticks) below the independent-agent baseline ($8.02$, dashed); the location is robust but its margin over the adjacent fast cadences ($K{=}1,4$) is not resolved (Appendix~\ref {app:effect-sizes}). Error bars and shaded band are 95\% bootstrap CIs.}}{23}{figure.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:bottleneck-shift}{{7}{23}{Bottleneck shift across eight peer cadences (40-seed sweep). Top: $P(M^\star |R^\star )$ falls and $P(C^\star |M^\star )$ rises in $K$ (moderate, cluster-robust Spearman effect sizes $-0.53$ and $+0.43$; CIs in Appendix~\ref {app:effect-sizes}). Bottom: mean time-to-success has an interior minimum at $K=8$ ($7.47$ ticks) below the independent-agent baseline ($8.02$, dashed); the location is robust but its margin over the adjacent fast cadences ($K{=}1,4$) is not resolved (Appendix~\ref {app:effect-sizes}). Error bars and shaded band are 95\% bootstrap CIs}{figure.7}{}}
